  "query_preview": "..\n(Tomorrow through Thursday)\nIssued at 1140 AM CDT Thu Sep 3 2026\n\nUpper ridging will hold strong over the forecast area through at\nleast the next week, with unseasonably hot conditions continuing\nthrough the forecast period. Heat headlines will likely continue\nas highs stay near the triple digits with heat indices in excess \nof 105 degrees for many locations through the middle part of next\nweek. Rain chances will remain very low during the period as \nwell, though an isolated shower or two will be possible each \nafternoon, especially in the higher terrain areas with some \ndeeper moisture streaming over the region. Widespread meaningful \nrainfall remains outside the range of the forecast however. Thus, \ndrought conditions are expected to worsen and localized higher \nfire concerns will continue under occasionally breezy conditions \nduring the afternoon hours.\n\nBowlan",
